{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/ecb5438cf7f7f46f9579bb687b865a90.apng?t=1760109961\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/ecb5438cf7f7f46f9579bb687b865a90.poster.avif?t=1760109961\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/b33e0b107c143381fc210f2156c53200.avif?t=1760109961\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong> a variety of magical stages in a Metroidvania-esque world filled with branching paths, hidden secrets, and rewarding backtracking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BATTLE</strong> a wide array of enemies in fast-paced magical combat, from tricky minions to cunning bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER</strong> a diverse arsenal of elemental spells, each with unique effects and upgrade potential with the Combo Counter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EQUIP</strong> Arnin with specific gear to enhance your abilities and customize your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLOCK</strong> special abilities  that open new paths and help conquer complex level challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNCOVER</strong> hidden lore scattered across the world to reveal the truth behind the chaos and unlock the game's true ending.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/24a4ea2f79a850152a339a47c43dbcc6.avif?t=1760109961\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spell Combo System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Keep the pressure on! Landing hits builds your Combo Counter, powering up your spells across multiple levels and unlocking explosive new behaviors at peak performance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/f3160139a6572dbfe39fce325b110213.poster.avif?t=1760109961\" width=800 height=311 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/f3160139a6572dbfe39fce325b110213.webm?t=1760109961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elemental System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the forces of Fire, Water, Earth, Wind, and Spirit. Each element has strengths, neutrality and weaknesses, so smart spell choices and timing are key to survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/830704e125d413b5de3d6557243b4768.apng?t=1760109961\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/830704e125d413b5de3d6557243b4768.poster.avif?t=1760109961\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new, interconnecting stages and hidden paths as you progress, with every exit leading somewhere new, or back to familiar places with fresh possibilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/f6d4c3269a786510a3d0f0ef709a47fe.poster.avif?t=1760109961\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/f6d4c3269a786510a3d0f0ef709a47fe.webm?t=1760109961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/f6d4c3269a786510a3d0f0ef709a47fe.mp4?t=1760109961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-Op Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend via local co-op or remote play to tackle dungeons, duel bosses, and double the magical mayhem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/0d28fcee1e32508c670213612ed6024d.poster.avif?t=1760109961\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/0d28fcee1e32508c670213612ed6024d.webm?t=1760109961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/0d28fcee1e32508c670213612ed6024d.mp4?t=1760109961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Charming minigames</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step away from the chaos for a spell with minigames that offer fun challenges and worthwhile rewards! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/dbb9ad953d3d486af34b36ef8427b206.poster.avif?t=1760109961\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/dbb9ad953d3d486af34b36ef8427b206.webm?t=1760109961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/dbb9ad953d3d486af34b36ef8427b206.mp4?t=1760109961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/5f47f8fa2d9971a052bb6b6c5d84d978.avif?t=1760109961\" width=700 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When the world unravels, rewrite it with magic.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arnin, a powerful mage and guardian of the Elemental Lords, returns from the astral plane to find her world in ruin. Freed from imprisonment by a mysterious figure, the Elemental Lords\u2014chaotic and destructive manifestations of raw magic\u2014now ravage the land of Wyn, twisting it with their volatile power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As arcane energy surges and ancient wards fail, it\u2019s up to you to restore balance. Take control of Arnin as she traverses shattered realms, rescues survivors, and confronts the fury of flame, flood, wind, stone, and spirit. Chain devastating spell combos, command elemental forces, and uncover forgotten secrets hidden within labyrinthine lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who unleashed the Elemental Lords\u2014and why? Wyn's fate lies in your hands, if your magic is strong enough to withstand what\u2019s to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3488640?t=1760109961","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/7db43d9cd59b8b4f4d32f0a871101c5af631ad58/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760109961","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/cebb5c89bae0f82548c5d5a35d0e44bbb3aa77bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760109961","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/cebb5c89bae0f82548c5d5a35d0e44bbb3aa77bc/capsule_18