/3488640/extras/830704e125d413b5de3d6557243b4768.apng?t=1760109961\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/830704e125d413b5de3d6557243b4768.poster.avif?t=1760109961\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new, interconnecting stages and hidden paths as you progress, with every exit leading somewhere new, or back to familiar places with fresh possibilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/f6d4c3269a786510a3d0f0ef709a47fe.poster.avif?t=1760109961\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/f6d4c3269a786510a3d0f0ef709a47fe.webm?t=1760109961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/f6d4c3269a786510a3d0f0ef709a47fe.mp4?t=1760109961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-Op Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend via local co-op or remote play to tackle dungeons, duel bosses, and double the magical mayhem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/0d28fcee1e32508c670213612ed6024d.poster.avif?t=1760109961\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/0d28fcee1e32508c670213612ed6024d.webm?t=1760109961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/0d28fcee1e32508c670213612ed6024d.mp4?t=1760109961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Charming minigames</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step away from the chaos for a spell with minigames that offer fun challenges and worthwhile rewards! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/dbb9ad953d3d486af34b36ef8427b206.poster.avif?t=1760109961\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/dbb9ad953d3d486af34b36ef8427b206.webm?t=1760109961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/dbb9ad953d3d486af34b36ef8427b206.mp4?t=1760109961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488640/extras/5f47f8fa2d9971a052bb6b6c5d84d978.avif?t=1760109961\" width=700 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When the world unravels, rewrite it with magic.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arnin, a powerful mage and guardian of the Elemental Lords, returns from the astral plane to find her world in ruin. Freed from imprisonment by a mysterious figure, the Elemental Lords\u2014chaotic and destructive manifestations of raw magic\u2014now ravage the land of Wyn, twisting it with their volatile power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As arcane energy surges and ancient wards fail, it\u2019s up to you to restore balance. Take control of Arnin as she traverses shattered realms, rescues survivors, and confronts the fury of flame, flood, wind, stone, and spirit. Chain devastating spell combos, command elemental forces, and uncover forgotten secrets hidden within labyrinthine lands.</p><p c